<item>
            <title>[JGVT-2491] Balance Interface: Add Signals Metadata and Update User(Name) in Biovia Equipment Logbook</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2491</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a User,&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;I want&lt;/b&gt; the system to update&#160;the Biovia Logbook entry associated with the measure event,&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;So that&lt;/b&gt; the logbook entry clearly logs why and by whom the Equipment was used&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Design Notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Retrieval from Balance Measures is technically managed via Biovia OneLab -&amp;gt; Signals. As a result, Biovia OneLab automatically logs this action into the Equipment Logbook (OOTB functionality) as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Event Time: Date &amp;amp; Time of measure (triggering &apos;Measure&apos; in Interface) - Note Express in OOTB Biovia Onelab format = yyyy-MMM-dd hh:mm:ss&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Event Type = &apos;Measure&apos; (when Outcome = Success) or &apos;Command&apos; (when Outcome = Failure)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Outcome = &apos;Success&apos; or &apos;Failure&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Event Context: OOTB Biovia value&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Equipment warning: OOTB Warning Message Biovia&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Created By = Service Account (e.g.&#160;SA-PRD-ELN-HUB-UAT)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Date Created = Date &amp;amp; Time of measure (triggering &apos;Measure&apos; in Interface) - Note Express in OOTB Biovia Onelab format = yyyy-MMM-dd hh:mm:ss&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Measurement: OOTB Biovia hyperlink or empty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Testing Notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To verify whether &apos;Date Created&apos; + &apos;Event Time&apos; (Biovia Logbook) = Date/Time when the User triggers the external measure action in the Balance interface, Tester can look at the Balance Date field (&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1169&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Auto-Calculate Fit for GxP field and Auto-populate Balance Data Field with Balance Interface metadata&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1169&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1169&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;) which also shows Date/Time when user triggers event.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note: History of Logbook is still referring to the Service Account. This is acceptable for testing and can be excluded for this story. A separate story will be created to remediate Service Accounts.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
