                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A Signals Experiment with
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;one or more hub-connected balances in the Equipment Table (Equipment Class = Balance)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Table Template Preparation Sub (with external action)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User has added one or more internal references to items from &apos;GxP CISPro Materials&apos;, &apos;GxP Biovia Samples&apos; or &apos;GxP Preparations&apos; in the Preparations sub table.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User is in the Balance Interface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the User triggers the external action to pull in balance weighing measurements in the Balance interface &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Then&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;the User shall notice that&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;the System populates the &apos;Remarks&apos; field of&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;the Balance&apos;s Biovia Logbook record as follows:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Remarks (Biovia Onelab, Equipment Logbook) = Experiment Name (Signals Properties) | Username | User (e.g. E000001 | wvermeu4 | wim vermeulen)&lt;/font&gt;&#160;with
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Username = J&amp;amp;J Username triggering the measure action in the interface (e.g wvermeu4)&#160;
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Note: J&amp;amp;J User Name can be retrieved from the User&apos;s email address (Users), but remove everything starting from the @ symbol (including the @ itself).&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;User = User triggering the measure action in the Interface (e.g. Wim Vermeulen)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

